    "title": "🎁 Freebies Up for Grabs in Wilson - Plants, Furniture & More - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 hours ago Looking for something useful without spending a dime? Wilson neighbors are giving away a few great items this week — from garden plants to furniture and even an RV hitch.\nJuniper FREE Lots of mature Juniper plants are available for free — you just need to come dig them up yourself. Perfect for anyone looking to add greenery to their yard or start a landscaping project.\nLocation: Wilson, NC\nCondition: New (freshly dug)\nSource: Facebook Marketplace\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nFree stuff A mix of household items and men’s clothing (size XXL) are being given away. The post mentions furniture and other home goods — you’ll need a trailer to pick everything up.\nLocation: Bailey, NC (near Wilson)\nCondition: Used - Good\nSource: Facebook Marketplace\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nRV Hitch If you’ve got a camper or trailer, this RV hitch could come in handy. The owner no longer needs it after selling their RV.\nLocation: Wilson, NC\nCondition: Used - Good\nSource: Facebook Marketplace\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nFree items like these tend to go fast, so if something catches your eye, reach out to the poster soon!\nPlease note: Availability changes quickly. Some items listed here may have already been claimed, and links may no longer be active. Contact the poster directly for the most up-to-date information.\n1",
